    "intro_narrative": "You have awakened in the forgotten sanctum of the Archmage Elowen, a realm where arcane magic and ancient logic intertwine. The grand chamber is filled with mystical artifacts, stone altars, and glowing crystals that pulse with dormant power. Your ultimate goal is to awaken The Grand Altar at the center of the room to open the portal back to your world. To do so, you must restore the flow of magical energy through the sanctum's ancient devices. Every artifact is connected in a delicate web of power; the energy harnessed by one relic will spark life into another. Explore the chamber, uncover the hidden relationships between these mythical instruments, and guide the arcane forces to the final altar before the sanctum seals itself forever.",
